        "text_i8UgfL": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It’s more than a store. The new Obama Shop celebrates our work to empower the next generation of changemakers in Chicago and across the globe through carefully curated products and goods. Embracing the ideals of the Obamas, the Shop features items that encourage civic participation, push imagination and intellectual curiosity, promote wellness and sustainability, and bring joy and hope in times of uncertainty. Our values are not only seen in the products themselves: every item you buy supports our work to train young leaders, giving them the tools they need to create change in their communities.</p>",
